      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Since you feel lightheaded, finding a calm, dimly lit space to sit down immediately is the best first step. Try taking slow, deep breaths to help regulate your nervous system. Avoid staring at bright screens right now, as this can worsen eye sensitivity and dizziness. If the feeling persists or gets worse, please take a short break or let your supervisor know you need some time to stabilize.",
